SUMMARY:Day 6 Morning: The cost
DESCRIPTION:Week 1: See It. You can't fix what you won't count.\n\nWrite a
  specific list of what lying has cost you: trust\, peace\, money\, time\, 
 intimacy\, sleep\, respect for yourself. Names and moments\, not general i
 deas.\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'l
 l say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Lying less goes with better health and relati
 onships. The payoff of this work isn't only your marriage. You should also
  start to feel better. (Kelly & Wang (2012)\, American Psychological Assoc
 iation convention)
