SUMMARY:Day 7 Morning: Week 1 review
DESCRIPTION:Week 1: See It. You can't fix what you won't count.\n\nTonight
  is your first weekly review. Today\, keep counting. Also pick your accoun
 tability brother: one man you will text your numbers to every week.\n\nBef
 ore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\
 n\nWhy it works: Tracking your behavior changes your behavior. The nightly
  ledger is the written record. The weekly text with your numbers to your a
 ccountability brother is the reporting. (Harkin et al. (2016)\, Psychologi
 cal Bulletin)
