SUMMARY:Week 1 review
DESCRIPTION:WEEKLY REVIEW (20 min)\nAdd up this week's ledgers: lies told\
 , lies caught\, corrections made. Text the three numbers to your brother. 
 Share the week's patterns with your witness.\n\nNext week: The Fear Undern
 eath. You told us why you lie: fear of failing and fear of not being accep
 ted. This week you find exactly where those fears live and what they've be
 en buying you.
