SUMMARY:Week 2 review
DESCRIPTION:WEEKLY REVIEW (20 min)\nAdd up this week's ledgers: lies told\
 , lies caught\, corrections made. Text the three numbers to your brother. 
 Share the week's patterns with your witness.\n\nNext week: The Pause. The 
 lie usually leaves your mouth before you've decided anything. This week yo
 u build the gap between the urge and the words\, and you fill it with true
  sentences you've written ahead of time.
