SUMMARY:Day 21 Morning: Week 3 review
DESCRIPTION:Week 3: The Pause. Lies are fast. Truth needs three seconds.\n
 \nRead your if-then plans once this morning. Talk with your witness about 
 whether it's time to offer your wife your weekly numbers. If it is\, ask h
 er whether she wants them.\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If _
 __ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Tracking your behavior c
 hanges your behavior. The nightly ledger is the written record. The weekly
  text with your numbers to your accountability brother is the reporting. (
 Harkin et al. (2016)\, Psychological Bulletin)
