SUMMARY:Week 3 review
DESCRIPTION:WEEKLY REVIEW (20 min)\nAdd up this week's ledgers: lies told\
 , lies caught\, corrections made. Text the three numbers to your brother. 
 Share the week's patterns with your witness.\n\nNext week: Small Truths\, 
 Out Loud. Counselors call this exposure: you practice the thing you fear i
 n small\, planned steps until your body learns that the truth doesn't kill
  you.
