SUMMARY:Day 29 Morning: The inventory
DESCRIPTION:Week 5: Repair. Telling the truth is the start. Repair is the 
 work.\n\nStart a private\, written inventory of the lies that have affecte
 d your wife. Facts only\, no excuses. Your witness sees it first. This is 
 not a midnight confession.\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If _
 __ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Secrets weigh on you eve
 n when nobody is asking. The lies you're still carrying cost you every day
 \, not just when you're questioned. That's part of why Week 5 plans a full
  disclosure. (Slepian\, Chun & Mason (2017)\, Journal of Personality and S
 ocial Psychology)
