SUMMARY:Day 30 Morning: No trickle truth
DESCRIPTION:Week 5: Repair. Telling the truth is the start. Repair is the 
 work.\n\nKnow this: telling the truth in pieces\, a little more each time 
 you're caught\, does more damage than the original lie. Read the disclosur
 e plan in this guide tonight\, and set a date with your witness to go over
  your inventory.\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens
 \, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Full disclosure\, with support\, i
 s usually seen as right afterward. Plan one full disclosure with your witn
 ess\, using the disclosure plan in this guide (Week 5). Don't let it come 
 out in pieces\, and don't do it in a panic. (Schneider\, Corley & Irons (1
 998)\, Sexual Addiction & Compulsivity)
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 30 Morning: No trickle truth
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
