SUMMARY:Day 31 Morning: Her side
DESCRIPTION:Week 5: Repair. Telling the truth is the start. Repair is the 
 work.\n\nToday\, try to see it from her side. What has it been like to liv
 e with a man whose word she couldn't count on?\n\nBefore you go\, write to
 day's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Coup
 les therapy has tested models for repairing betrayal. Free and low-cost op
 tions come first: a church marriage ministry or marriage workshop\, or a u
 niversity training clinic. If you can afford it later\, look for a couples
  therapist trained in EFT\, the Gottman Method or affair recovery. (Makine
 n & Johnson (2006)\, Journal of Consulting and Clinical Psychology\; Bauco
 m\, Snyder & Gordon)
