SUMMARY:Day 33 Morning: Answer the whole question
DESCRIPTION:Week 5: Repair. Telling the truth is the start. Repair is the 
 work.\n\nWhen she asks you something\, answer it fully the first time. If 
 you need time: "I'll answer that fully. Give me until tonight." Then do it
 .\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll sa
 y ___."\n\nWhy it works: Full disclosure\, with support\, is usually seen 
 as right afterward. Plan one full disclosure with your witness\, using the
  disclosure plan in this guide (Week 5). Don't let it come out in pieces\,
  and don't do it in a panic. (Schneider\, Corley & Irons (1998)\, Sexual A
 ddiction & Compulsivity)
