 rks: Trust after lying comes back slowly\, through actions. Set your expec
 tations: this is a long road\, and words won't carry you. Make small\, spe
 cific promises and keep them exactly (Day 40). Never demand trust (Day 39)
 . (Schweitzer\, Hershey & Bradlow (2006)\, Organizational Behavior and Hum
