SUMMARY:Day 41 Morning: Say the feeling
DESCRIPTION:Week 6: Transparency. Trust is rebuilt on boring days.\n\nMany
  lies stand in for feelings. Today\, say one feeling out loud: "I'm afraid
 ." "I'm embarrassed." "I'm stressed about money."\n\nBefore you go\, write
  today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: W
 riting about hard things helps a little. The evening questions and letters
  are writing exercises. They help\, but they're one tool among several\, n
 ot a cure. (Frattaroli (2006)\, Psychological Bulletin)
