SUMMARY:Day 42 Morning: Week 6 review
DESCRIPTION:Week 6: Transparency. Trust is rebuilt on boring days.\n\nAsk 
 your wife one question today\, and only if she's open to it: "What's one t
 hing that would help you feel safer with me this week?" Just listen.\n\nBe
 fore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."
 \n\nWhy it works: Couples therapy has tested models for repairing betrayal
 . Free and low-cost options come first: a church marriage ministry or marr
 iage workshop\, or a university training clinic. If you can afford it late
 r\, look for a couples therapist trained in EFT\, the Gottman Method or af
 fair recovery. (Makinen & Johnson (2006)\, Journal of Consulting and Clini
 cal Psychology\; Baucom\, Snyder & Gordon)
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 42 Morning: Week 6 review
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
