SUMMARY:Day 45 Morning: Your relapse plan
DESCRIPTION:Week 7: A Man Whose Word Holds. Not a streak. An identity.\n\n
 Write it and sign it: If I lie\, I will 1) correct it the same day\, 2) lo
 g it\, 3) write myself two honest\, kind sentences instead of tearing myse
 lf down\, 4) tell my brother within 24 hours\, 5) tell my witness at our n
 ext talk. I don't start over at Day 1.\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if
 -then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: A slip doesn
 't have to become a relapse. If you lie\, you correct it\, log it\, tell y
 our brother\, and keep going. You never go back to Day 1. (Marlatt & Gordo
 n\, Relapse Prevention\; Larimer\, Palmer & Marlatt (1999))
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 45 Morning: Your relapse plan
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
