SUMMARY:Day 46 Morning: Teach it
DESCRIPTION:Week 7: A Man Whose Word Holds. Not a streak. An identity.\n\n
 How you handle your own mistakes teaches your kids how to handle theirs. A
 dmit a mistake in front of them today\, in a way that fits their age.\n\nB
 efore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___.
 "\n\nWhy it works: Lying less goes with better health and relationships. T
 he payoff of this work isn't only your marriage. You should also start to 
 feel better. (Kelly & Wang (2012)\, American Psychological Association con
 vention)
