SUMMARY:Day 47 Morning: What the truth gave you
DESCRIPTION:Week 7: A Man Whose Word Holds. Not a streak. An identity.\n\n
 List five things that seven weeks of truth have given you.\n\nBefore you g
 o\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it
  works: Self-compassion makes men more likely to make amends. Beating your
 self up feeds shame\, and shame feeds hiding. After a slip\, you write you
 rself two honest\, kind sentences\, then you go fix it. (Breines & Chen (2
 012)\, Personality and Social Psychology Bulletin)
