SUMMARY:Day 48 Morning: Your ongoing system
DESCRIPTION:Week 7: A Man Whose Word Holds. Not a streak. An identity.\n\n
 Decide what keeps running after Day 49. Keep: the nightly ledger\, the wee
 kly review\, a weekly text to your brother\, and regular talks with your w
 itness or your group. Optional: the midday check.\n\nBefore you go\, write
  today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: T
 racking your behavior changes your behavior. The nightly ledger is the wri
 tten record. The weekly text with your numbers to your accountability brot
 her is the reporting. (Harkin et al. (2016)\, Psychological Bulletin)
